# Implement Multi-Tenancy with Finbuckle.MultiTenant

## Problem Statement
The application currently lacks multi-tenant capabilities, limiting its use to single-organization deployments. This prevents:
- SaaS deployment model
- Data isolation between organizations
- Tenant-specific customizations
- Scalable enterprise solutions
- Cost-effective resource sharing

## Business Requirements

### Tenant Isolation Strategies
1. **Database per Tenant** - Complete isolation, highest security
2. **Schema per Tenant** - Balanced isolation and resource usage
3. **Shared Database with Row-Level Security** - Most efficient, requires careful implementation
4. **Hybrid Approach** - Premium tenants get dedicated databases

### Tenant Identification Methods
- Subdomain: `tenant1.app.com`, `tenant2.app.com`
- Path: `app.com/tenant1`, `app.com/tenant2`
- Header: Custom `X-Tenant-Id` header
- Claim: From JWT token claims

## Technical Implementation

### Phase 1: Core Multi-Tenancy Setup

#### Install and Configure Finbuckle
```csharp
// Program.cs
builder.Services.AddMultiTenant<TenantInfo>()
    .WithHostStrategy()           // subdomain.app.com
    .WithRouteStrategy()          // app.com/tenant
    .WithHeaderStrategy("X-Tenant-Id")  // API calls
    .WithClaimStrategy("tenant_id")     // JWT tokens
    .WithEFCoreStore<ApplicationDbContext>()
    .WithPerTenantAuthentication();
```

#### Tenant Info Model
```csharp
public class TenantInfo : ITenantInfo
{
    public string Id { get; set; }
    public string Identifier { get; set; }
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public string ConnectionString { get; set; }
    public Dictionary<string, object> Items { get; set; }
    
    // Custom properties
    public string Plan { get; set; } // Free, Standard, Premium
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; set; }
    public bool IsActive { get; set; }
    public TenantSettings Settings { get; set; }
}
```

### Phase 2: Database Strategy Implementation

#### Shared Database with Tenant Filter
```csharp
public class ApplicationDbContext : MultiTenantDbContext
{
    public ApplicationDbContext(TenantInfo tenantInfo, DbContextOptions options) 
        : base(tenantInfo, options) { }
    
    protected override void OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder modelBuilder)
    {
        base.OnModelCreating(modelBuilder);
        
        // Automatic tenant filtering
        modelBuilder.Entity<Person>().IsMultiTenant();
        
        // Global query filter
        modelBuilder.Entity<Person>()
            .HasQueryFilter(p => p.TenantId == TenantInfo.Id);
    }
}
```

#### Database Per Tenant
```csharp
public class TenantDbContextFactory
{
    public ApplicationDbContext CreateDbContext(TenantInfo tenant)
    {
        var optionsBuilder = new DbContextOptionsBuilder<ApplicationDbContext>();
        optionsBuilder.UseSqlServer(tenant.ConnectionString);
        return new ApplicationDbContext(tenant, optionsBuilder.Options);
    }
}
```

### Phase 3: Tenant Management

#### Tenant Admin API
```csharp
[ApiController]
[Route("api/admin/tenants")]
[Authorize(Roles = "SystemAdmin")]
public class TenantManagementController : ControllerBase
{
    [HttpPost]
    public async Task<IActionResult> CreateTenant(CreateTenantRequest request)
    {
        // Create tenant
        // Provision database
        // Run migrations
        // Seed initial data
    }
    
    [HttpPut("{tenantId}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> UpdateTenant(string tenantId, UpdateTenantRequest request)
    {
        // Update tenant info
        // Handle plan changes
    }
    
    [HttpDelete("{tenantId}")]
    public async Task<IActionResult> DeleteTenant(string tenantId)
    {
        // Soft delete tenant
        // Archive data
        // Clean up resources
    }
}
```

### Phase 4: Tenant-Specific Features

#### Customization Per Tenant
```csharp
public interface ITenantCustomization
{
    Theme GetTheme();
    FeatureFlags GetFeatures();
    EmailSettings GetEmailSettings();
}

public class TenantCustomizationService : ITenantCustomization
{
    private readonly TenantInfo _tenant;
    
    public Theme GetTheme()
    {
        return _tenant.Plan switch
        {
            "Premium" => CustomTheme.Load(_tenant.Id),
            _ => Theme.Default
        };
    }
    
    public FeatureFlags GetFeatures()
    {
        return _tenant.Plan switch
        {
            "Free" => FeatureFlags.Basic,
            "Standard" => FeatureFlags.Standard,
            "Premium" => FeatureFlags.All,
            _ => FeatureFlags.None
        };
    }
}
```

## Tasks

### Setup
