## Acceptance Criteria

### Core Functionality
- [ ] Multiple tenants can use the application simultaneously
- [ ] Complete data isolation between tenants
- [ ] Tenant resolution works for all strategies
- [ ] No data leakage between tenants
- [ ] Tenant context available throughout request pipeline

### Management
